        "answer": {
          "short": "$y\\ne 5$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{x-2}&\\ne 0\\\\\\frac{3}{x-2}+5&\\ne 5\\end{aligned}$$\nThe reciprocal term takes every non-zero real value, so the range is $y\\ne 5$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
