          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}(x+1)^2&\\ge 0\\\\2(x+1)^2&\\ge 0\\\\2(x+1)^2-6&\\ge -6\\end{aligned}$$\nRange: $y\\ge -6$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
